  "Description": {
    "DefaultText": "Shows the current phase of the moon. Fuller moons provide more moonlight and strengthen moon rituals.\n\nThe new moon is the weakest phase. It gives way to the waxing crescent, then the waxing gibbous, and finally the full moon.\nThe full moon is the strongest phase. It is followed by the waning gibbous, then the waning crescent, before returning to the new moon.",
    "Text": "显示当前月相。满月月光更明亮，更有利于月之仪式。\\n\\n新月是最弱的月相。之后依次是上弦月、盈凸月，最后是满月。\\n满月是最强的阶段。之后依次是亏凸月、残月，最后再次回到新月。",
    "zh": "显示当前月相。满月月光更明亮，更有利于月之仪式。\\n\\n新月是最弱的月相。之后依次是上弦月、盈凸月，最后是满月。\\n满月是最强的阶段。之后依次是亏凸月、残月，最后再次回到新月。",
    "en": "Shows the current phase of the moon. Fuller moons provide more moonlight and strengthen moon rituals.\\n\\nThe new moon is the weakest phase. It gives way to the waxing crescent, then the waxing gibbous, and finally the full moon.\\nThe full moon is the strongest phase. It is followed by the waning gibbous, then the waning crescent, before returning to the new moon.",
    "ja": "Shows the current phase of the moon. Fuller moons provide more moonlight and strengthen moon rituals.\n\nThe new moon is the weakest phase. It gives way to the waxing crescent, then the waxing gibbous, and finally the full moon.\nThe full moon is the strongest phase. It is followed by the waning gibbous, then the waning crescent, before returning to the new moon."
  },
